# OpenCode. Installed even before the tool is: it reads these on first run.
# Rules: https://opencode.ai/docs/rules/  - global ~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md.
#   A project-level AGENTS.md takes priority and the global file is NOT loaded
#   alongside it in that project.
# Skills: https://opencode.ai/docs/skills/ - OpenCode already reads
#   ~/.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md, which the claude-code agent installs, so no
#   second copy here (the same skill name twice would collide).
DETECT=""
RULES_FILE="$HOME/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md"
RULES_TITLE="AGENTS.md"
SKILLS_DIR=""
